Schedule:Compact,
    Continuous,               !- Name
    on/off,                   !- Schedule Type Limits Name
    Through: 12/31,           !- Field 1
    For: AllDays,             !- Field 2
    Until: 24:00,             !- Field 3
    1.0;                      !- Field 4

Schedule:Compact,
    Off,                      !- Name
    on/off,                   !- Schedule Type Limits Name
    Through: 12/31,           !- Field 1
    For: AllDays,             !- Field 2
    Until: 24:00,             !- Field 3
